 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board, making it visible to anyone with its secret public URL (read-only, drafted cards are never shown). Only admins can publish boards. Publishing an already published board keeps its existing URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board, whose `public_url` field now contains the secret public URL (e.g. `http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/Dq3xwH8sQ1kCmPdyZ5r9Ln2T`).
+
+Columns and published cards of a public board can be opened at `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id` and `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number`.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Its public URL stops working immediately. Only admins can unpublish boards.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `200 OK` with the board, whose `public_url` field is `null`.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
